/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Never commit an API key. The dev key lives outside the repo entirely
# (~/.nfd-scanner-dev-key); these patterns are a second line of defence.
.env
*.key
scanner-key*

# Raw Roblox logs carry a userid, username, server IPs and a join ticket with
# personal data. Keep them local; commit only the scrubbed fixture.
*.raw.log
